    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} releases spores onto a Medium or Small corpse within 5 feet of it that wasn’t a Construct or an Undead. After 24 hours, the corpse rises as a @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.creatures.Actor.PFWVCSHL8cQeifFg]{Myconid Spore Servant}. It stays animated for [[/r 1d4 + 1]] weeks or until destroyed, and it can’t be animated this way again.</p>",
